        "hypothesis": "Combining the previously measured persistent OpenMP team, SIMD convergence reduction, and buffer swapping with contiguous row-major storage may improve locality and reduce allocation and indexing overhead without changing the stencil, convergence test, or output.",
        "id": "dce439fc40aa4642",
        "ordinal": 2,
